        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Royal Wahingdoh F.C.\n- Places: Shillong, Meghalaya, India\n- People: Bowari Khongstia\n- Roles: defender\n- Competitions: Indian I-League\n\nFacts:\n- Shillong is a city in India, and it had a population of 143,007 in the 2011 census, making it the 330th most populous city in India.\n- Bowari Khongstia was born on 19 January 1993.\n- Royal Wahingdoh F.C. is a men's professional football club based in Shillong, Meghalaya.\n- Royal Wahingdoh F.C. participates in the Indian I-League.\n- Bowari Khongstia is an Indian professional footballer who plays as a defender for Royal Wahingdoh F.C. in the I-League.",
